# 📋 Fee Module — Complete User Guide
### For the Fee Collector / Accountant

---

## 🖥️ How to Open the Fee Module

1. Log in to the Admin Portal
2. Click **"Fee"** in the left sidebar menu
3. You will land on the **Students Fee Overview** page

---

## 📅 STEP 1 — Set Fee Amounts for Each Class (Do This First!)

> [!IMPORTANT]
> Do this **once at the start**. This sets the standard fee (Tuition, Library, Exam, etc.) for each class so you don't have to type it for every student.

1. Click the **"⚙ Fee Settings"** button (top left)
2. Select the class from the dropdown (e.g. *9th Biology*, *1st Year Pre-Medical*)
3. Fill in:
   - **Monthly Tuition Fee** — e.g. `3000`
   - **Library / Lab Fee** — e.g. `200`
   - **Paper Fund / Exam Fee** — e.g. `150`
   - **Annual Fee**, **Transport Fee** (if applicable)
4. Click **"💾 Save Defaults for [Class Name]"**
5. Repeat for every class

---

## 📆 STEP 2 — Open Monthly Fee Records

### Option A — Open This Month Only (Quick)
1. Click **"📅 Open Month(s)"** button
2. In the popup: keep **From Month** and **To Month** both as the current month
3. Set **Apply to:** `All Classes (Whole College)`
4. Click **✓ Generate Fee Records**

### Option B — Open Multiple Past Months at Once (Backlog)
Use this when you want to add January, February, March records all at once.

1. Click **"📅 Open Month(s)"**
2. Set **From Month:** `January 2026`
3. Set **To Month:** `March 2026` (or whatever the current month is)
4. Set class to `All Classes` or a specific class
5. *(Optional)* If those months were **already paid**, check: ✅ **"Mark all as already Paid"**
6. *(Optional)* If you want a **custom fee amount** (different from defaults), check: ✅ **"Enter custom fee amounts"** and type in the amounts
7. Click **✓ Generate Fee Records** (or **✓ Generate & Mark Paid**)

> [!TIP]
> Already-existing months are skipped automatically — you won't create duplicates.

---

## 💰 STEP 3 — Receive a Payment from a Student

1. Find the student in the table (use the search box to type their name or ID)
2. Click on their **row** — a panel opens on the right side
3. At the top of the panel you'll see a **"Viewing Month"** dropdown
   - Use this to switch between **January, February, March**, etc.
   - Each month shows: ✓ Paid, ✗ Unpaid, or ◑ Partial
4. Check the fee breakdown is correct
5. Click the green **"Receive Payment"** button
6. The student's status will change to **Paid ✓** immediately

> [!NOTE]
> If you need to change the fee amount before marking paid, click **"Edit"** first, adjust the numbers, click **"Save Fees"**, then click **"Receive Payment"**.

---

## 🖨️ STEP 4 — Print a Challan / Receipt

After marking a student as paid:
1. Click on the student's row
2. Click the blue **"Print Invoice"** button in the right panel
3. A challan will open in a new window with a **✓ PAID** stamp
4. Your browser's print dialog will open automatically
5. Print and hand to the student

---

## 📊 STEP 5 — Print a Class Fee Report

Use this to print a full list of all students in a class with their payment status.

1. Click **"📊 Print Report"** button (top right of the page)
2. A bar appears below — select:
   - **Class** (or *All Classes*)
   - **Month** (e.g. *March 2026*)
3. Click **"🖨️ Generate Report"**
4. A printable table opens showing every student, amount due, amount paid, and status

---

## ✅ STEP 6 — Mark Entire Class as Paid (Bulk Action)

When a whole class has paid and you want to mark them all at once:

1. Click **"✓ Bulk Actions"** button (top right)
2. A green bar appears — select:
   - **Class** (or *All Classes*)
   - **Month** (e.g. *February 2026*)
3. Click **"✓ Mark All Paid"**
4. Confirm the popup — all students in that class/month are marked Paid instantly

---

## ⚠️ Adding Old/Previous Unpaid Dues (Arrears)

If a student owes money from a previous year or special charge:

1. Click on the student's row
2. Scroll down to **"Arrears Section"**
3. Type the amount (e.g. `5000`)
4. Click **"Add"**
5. The arrear appears in their fee history as a separate unpaid entry

---

## 🔍 Finding Fee Defaulters

Click the **"Defaulters"** tab in the student list — it automatically filters and shows only students with unpaid or partial fees.

---

## ❓ Common Questions

| Question | Answer |
|---|---|
| I opened a month but all amounts show RS 0 | Go to **Fee Settings** and save the fee amounts for each class first, then re-open the month |
| A student's status shows **"No Records"** | That student hasn't had a fee month opened yet. Click them and click **"+ Add Fee"** |
| I marked wrong student as paid | Click on the student → the Receive Payment button is disabled when paid. Use **Bulk Actions → Reset All Unpaid** to reverse |
| I want to see January's record not March's | Click the student → use the **"Viewing Month"** dropdown to switch months |
| I can't see the Print button | The student must have at least one fee record. Open a month for them first |
| Is data saved automatically? | ✅ Yes — every action saves to the database immediately |
